et of fall, the risks of contracting the disease are low.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Fact Check: False video alleges Berlin votes destroyed</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c625a6335b0b8fe18254391591ead8a0f6484d551f447cc058455e6d651f1f71</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:05:55Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T18:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fact-check-false-video-alleges-berlin-votes-destroyed/a-79333344--411939a21d7f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fact-check-false-video-alleges-berlin-votes-destroyed/a-79333344?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A video claiming to show AfD postal ballots being destroyed has gone viral ahead of Berlin's September 20 election. DW Fact Check examines the footage, the accounts sharing it and how widely it is really being viewed.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Zelenskyy holds inaugural 'Carpathian Eight' regional summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5d3c82e6098d78d3e34060ab731f9b95282818c135cb8b9fddefb356d5d0e8b1</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:05:58Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T17:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/zelenskyy-holds-inaugural-carpathian-eight-regional-summit/a-79333437--f5a836e47847.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/zelenskyy-holds-inaugural-carpathian-eight-regional-summit/a-79333437?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Zelenskyy said the summit was a "significant beginning" of a movement to strengthen ties with its neighboring countries.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German police probe arson attack on Wuppertal synagogue</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:216c5bd7f9a6a3e576c8d184cc5149b5132e847ffdbd2495000804bfff7f6360</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:06:01Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T15:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-arson-attack-on-wuppertal-synagogue/a-79331270--dce70b32746f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-arson-attack-on-wuppertal-synagogue/a-79331270?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The man detained shortly after allegedly trying to set fire to Wuppertal's synagogue made antisemitic comments to the arresting officers, prosecutors say. The 37-year-old Afghan citizen also had knives in his apartment.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Warren Buffett steps down as Berkshire Hathaway chairman</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1dc7723615c5f0a3062c3201b2c1f9f70e8e5cd8093222901d794022933885ec</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:06:04Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T15:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/warren-buffett-steps-down-as-berkshire-hathaway-chairman/a-79330594--2480bd95e8fe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/warren-buffett-steps-down-as-berkshire-hathaway-chairman/a-79330594?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Buffett's son, Howard, will succeed him in the role. Buffett had earlier stepped down as Berkshire's CEO last year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ever more Israelis moving to and investing in Cyprus</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:335ee95ab3c4c8adfcfc8995ec4fa347912c1e76e808b823c89f5b459203c9c0</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:06:07Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T15:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ever-more-israelis-moving-to-and-investing-in-cyprus/a-79330240--f9d83a8ed500.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ever-more-israelis-moving-to-and-investing-in-cyprus/a-79330240?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Over the past three years, more and more Israelis have been purchasing property and investing in Cyprus, with many moving to the island permanently. How has this changed the Cypriot economy and how are locals responding?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Canada and EU: A look at the bloc's special relationships</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae49cbedb8c408cf53481a2ea757820526de3288879864f8a0f66bd32f8e1381</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:06:10Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T14:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/canada-and-eu-a-look-at-the-bloc-s-special-relationships/a-79328797--41616c65f5bb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/canada-and-eu-a-look-at-the-bloc-s-special-relationships/a-79328797?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Though Canada may be some distance from Europe geographically, closer political ties are in the cards. With talk of an associate membership, DW takes a look at other arrangements the EU has with particular countries.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Strait of Hormuz attacks spill oil into Persian Gulf</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:19d6140c91c3e224d977291a5cd5b7d18cce82acae8149d025a3015b3c06cead</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:06:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T14:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/strait-of-hormuz-attacks-spill-oil-into-persian-gulf/a-79327092--09836173253c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/strait-of-hormuz-attacks-spill-oil-into-persian-gulf/a-79327092?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As war disrupts one of the world's busiest shipping lanes, satellite images reveal that oil is spreading toward protected coral reefs and mangrove forests.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Dual citizenship means Germany now in competition for talent</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0537129a1a04fb2bfbc4497964f14a0827b2bf0ad86f39b773c4aed178eff4b5</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:06:16Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T14:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" h