g</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Afghanistan's women: A national soccer team without a home</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:32163c461c626ac76768b82d6d9c95576fb92b37da655449c37d2d4ddd7ed01c</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:04:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/afghanistan-s-women-a-national-soccer-team-without-a-home/a-79139500--7cfb666b9c3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afghanistan-s-women-a-national-soccer-team-without-a-home/a-79139500?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Afghan women's national football team has finally been officially recognized by FIFA. Now the players want to make history both on and off the field.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>PISA 2025 results: Reading and math scores plummet worldwide</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b2115b38c11b2cb2d41230860b6d5291a7a09188b5d9adb5b076353c404822bb</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:04:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T07:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pisa-test-reveals-alarming-drop-in-reading-and-math-skills/a-79147293--6fcb0a53f051.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pisa-2025-results-reading-and-math-scores-plummet-worldwide/a-79147293?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The PISA 2025 results reveal record-low student performance, with digital distractions and AI use raising concerns. Germany is faring worse than ever.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Elversberg: Bundesliga newcomers from tiny town make waves</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1a66dd012631c0909e2b0918214032b2dbd5afe6a0a02f3a20b5a528b74eaa6d</id><updated>2026-09-18T19:04:49Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/elversberg-bundesliga-newcomers-from-tiny-town-make-waves/a-77194483--9d72